#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:5
#: dbadd8d8590a48bf9ff5bbcbc8142e53
msgid "Tuning Navigation"
msgstr "导航调参"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:7
#: 812ad210da62458a8cbd7aca4bc29509
msgid ""
"This page describes how to tune the Navigation control including "
"\"S-Curves\" and the \"Position controller\".  The lower level "
":ref:`speed<rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed>` and :ref:`turn rate<rover-"
"tuning-steering-rate>` controllers should be tuned before attempting to tune"
" this controller."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍如何调整导航控制器，包括「S 曲线」和「位置控制器」。在尝试调整此控制器之前，应先调整底层的 :ref:`速度<rover-tuning-"
"throttle-and-speed>` 和 :ref:`转向速率<rover-tuning-steering-rate>` 控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:12
#: 097bc6f23c734b97b5f47aac381c3bfa
msgid ""
"S-Curves and the position controller are used all the autonomous modes "
"including :ref:`Auto<auto-mode>`, :ref:`Guided<guided-mode>`, :ref:`RTL<rtl-"
"mode>` and :ref:`SmartRTL<smartrtl-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"S 曲线和位置控制器用于所有自主模式，包括 :ref:`Auto<auto-mode>`、:ref:`Guided<guided-"
"mode>`、:ref:`RTL<rtl-mode>` 和 :ref:`SmartRTL<smartrtl-mode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:15
#: a88bfcd972724ff18ab06db6adff474c
msgid "S-Curves"
msgstr "S 曲线"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:17
#: 0cb36f962f754cc9af953e5f3dc6bf6a
msgid ""
"S-Curves are used to plan a smooth path that brings the vehicle close to "
"each waypoint while not exceeding speed or acceleration limits.  The "
"resulting path includes continuous position and 2D velocity targets."
msgstr "S 曲线用于规划一条平滑路径，使车辆在不超过速度和加速度限制的前提下经过每个航点附近。生成的路径包含连续的位置和二维速度目标。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:19
#: 45d8f83552984338b77499ddf955fa0e
msgid "Factors affecting the path include:"
msgstr "影响路径的因素包括："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:21
#: e31474407f5c471694dc6ef1138b0bdd
msgid ""
"The vehicle will cut the corners but will always try to pass within "
":ref:`WP_RADIUS<WP_RADIUS>` or :ref:`TURN_RADIUS<TURN_RADIUS>` (whichever is"
" larger) of each waypoint"
msgstr ""
"车辆会切弯，但始终尝试在每个航点的 :ref:`WP_RADIUS<WP_RADIUS>` 或 "
":ref:`TURN_RADIUS<TURN_RADIUS>`（取较大值）范围内通过"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:22
#: 2a7300f7e2ab46af83ea9a3ee0f00677
msgid "The vehicle will cut the corners more at higher speeds"
msgstr "速度越快，切弯幅度越大"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:23
#: 19c3c752c7c445d7a8afb11e3ece8bf1
msgid ""
"The vehicle will cut the corners more if the maximum accelerations are "
"reduced (e.g. the lowest of :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_MAX<ATC_ACCEL_MAX>`, "
":ref:`ATC_DECEL_MAX<ATC_DECEL_MAX>` and "
":ref:`ATC_TURN_MAX_G<ATC_TURN_MAX_G>` * 9.81)"
msgstr ""
"最大加速度越小（即 "
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_MAX<ATC_ACCEL_MAX>`、:ref:`ATC_DECEL_MAX<ATC_DECEL_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`ATC_TURN_MAX_G<ATC_TURN_MAX_G>` * 9.81 三者中最小值越小），切弯幅度越大"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:24
#: 2fecbb9ce49d4e4f94ce16cbc9d09ddc
msgid ""
"The vehicle will slow down in the corners if necessary to pass within "
":ref:`WP_RADIUS<WP_RADIUS>` of the waypoint without exceeding the maximum "
"accelerations (e.g. the lowest of :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_MAX<ATC_ACCEL_MAX>`, "
":ref:`ATC_DECEL_MAX<ATC_DECEL_MAX>` and "
":ref:`ATC_TURN_MAX_G<ATC_TURN_MAX_G>` * 9.81)"
msgstr ""
"若有必要，车辆会在弯道减速，以在不超过最大加速度（即 "
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_MAX<ATC_ACCEL_MAX>`、:ref:`ATC_DECEL_MAX<ATC_DECEL_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`ATC_TURN_MAX_G<ATC_TURN_MAX_G>` * 9.81 三者中最小值）的前提下在航点 "
":ref:`WP_RADIUS<WP_RADIUS>` 范围内通过"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:25
#: 00d954e68e0b42d89107741c60538716
msgid ""
"Placing waypoints close together may lead to the vehicle traveling slowly"
msgstr "航点间距过近可能导致车辆行驶缓慢"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:28
#: 1b75d8ad966c46eb82fe8da2c8dba34e
msgid "Position Controller"
msgstr "位置控制器"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:30
#: d167b0b5615f4968958f20145a1ed6bc
msgid ""
"The position controller is responsible for calculating the desired speed and"
" turn rate so the vehicle follows the path between waypoints created by the "
"S-Curves (see above).  The desired speed and turn rate are then passed to "
"the lower level controllers."
msgstr "位置控制器负责计算期望速度和转向速率，使车辆沿 S 曲线（见上文）生成的航点间路径行驶。期望速度和转向速率随后传递给底层控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:32
#: e5a864a9b51f4308976a88dfab32f619
msgid "Method for tuning the position controller:"
msgstr "位置控制器调整方法："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:34
#: 34c0bc6260714c8485e80ed6bbe7a726
msgid "Connect the ground station to the vehicle using a telemetry radio"
msgstr "通过数传将地面站连接到车辆"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:35
#: f2f13f7487dc435e8ea52943c86631ca
msgid ""
"Create a rectangular or back-and-forth mission with long straight segments "
"and upload to the vehicle"
msgstr "创建包含长直线段的矩形或来回往返任务，并上传到车辆"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:40
#: bb8385c200684124acfa8434749f6a27
msgid ""
"Arm the vehicle (in :ref:`Manual<manual-mode>` or :ref:`Hold<hold-mode>`) "
"and then switch to :ref:`Auto<auto-mode>` mode"
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`Manual<manual-mode>` 或 :ref:`Hold<hold-mode>` 下解锁车辆，然后切换到 "
":ref:`Auto<auto-mode>` 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:41
#: 2baa74bed4674450bb1c498c2d24f14d
msgid ""
"Adjust these parameters to improve the vehicle's tracking along the lines"
msgstr "调整以下参数以改善车辆的直线跟踪效果"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:43
#: a1a54ce678614aac97dcd83df928acc2
msgid ""
"set :ref:`PSC_VEL_I<PSC_VEL_I>` and :ref:`PSC_VEL_D<PSC_VEL_D>` to zero"
msgstr "将 :ref:`PSC_VEL_I<PSC_VEL_I>` 和 :ref:`PSC_VEL_D<PSC_VEL_D>` 设为零"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:44
#: 3cbcb847569d44c5910171090f00542b
msgid ""
"increase :ref:`PSC_VEL_P<PSC_VEL_P>` until the vehicle tracks the corners "
"nicely without oscillating in the straights"
msgstr "逐步增大 :ref:`PSC_VEL_P<PSC_VEL_P>`，直至车辆能良好跟踪弯道而直线段不出现振荡"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:45
#: c144d9f9d24645b287606a09c2e774b1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"increase :ref:`PSC_VEL_D<PSC_VEL_D>` enough to make the corners more "
"responsive but without introducing oscillations in the straights.  This "
"should normally be not more than 10% of :ref:`PSC_VEL_P<PSC_VEL_P>`"
msgstr ""
"适当增大 :ref:`PSC_VEL_D<PSC_VEL_D>` 以使弯道响应更灵敏，但不要在直线段引入振荡。通常不应超过 "
":ref:`PSC_VEL_P<PSC_VEL_P>` 的 10%"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:46
#: ca5a67bbe87d44cea8cb8590538c48cd
#, python-format
msgid "set :ref:`PSC_VEL_I<PSC_VEL_I>` to 20% of :ref:`PSC_VEL_P<PSC_VEL_P>`"
msgstr "将 :ref:`PSC_VEL_I<PSC_VEL_I>` 设为 :ref:`PSC_VEL_P<PSC_VEL_P>` 的 20%"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:48
#: d9fdc822f5654d97a4c2d2bad10a7875
msgid "These values normally do not need to be changed"
msgstr "以下参数通常无需更改"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:50
#: 3ae3290358e343d0be034889a89a5420
msgid ""
":ref:`PSC_POS_P<PSC_POS_P>` should be left at 0.2 (the default).  This "
"converts the position error into a desired velocity.  Higher values will "
"lead to the vehicle trying to drive back to the line more quickly but if "
"raised too high may lead to oscillation"
msgstr ""
":ref:`PSC_POS_P<PSC_POS_P>` 应保持默认值 0.2，用于将位置误差转换为期望速度。值越高，车辆越快返回路线，但过高可能引起振荡"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:51
#: e4c3d01bac90400499ca5c43b61b80dd
msgid ":ref:`PSC_VEL_FF<PSC_VEL_FF>` should always be 0"
msgstr ":ref:`PSC_VEL_FF<PSC_VEL_FF>` 应始终为 0"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:52
#: 9d5794befc6a4954b0d11bea0d4e02ed
msgid ":ref:`PSC_VEL_IMAX<PSC_VEL_IMAX>` should always be 1"
msgstr ":ref:`PSC_VEL_IMAX<PSC_VEL_IMAX>` 应始终为 1"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:53
#: 271f57b737a54430966535b34c12c50d
msgid ""
":ref:`PSC_VEL_FLTD<PSC_VEL_FLTD>`, :ref:`PSC_VEL_FLTE<PSC_VEL_FLTE>` should "
"be left at the default of 5 although small vehicle may benefit from higher "
"values"
msgstr ""
":ref:`PSC_VEL_FLTD<PSC_VEL_FLTD>`、:ref:`PSC_VEL_FLTE<PSC_VEL_FLTE>` 应保留默认值 "
"5，但小型车辆可能受益于更高的值"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:55
#: 84dc443394c04e178b6430f0bc7764aa
msgid "It may also help to monitor the velocity controller PIDs in real-time"
msgstr "实时监控速度控制器 PID 数据也可能有所帮助"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:57
#: 4a44e9c389d74faa9c9681da49824592
msgid ""
"Ensure the mission has long straight segments aligned either North-South or "
"West-East"
msgstr "确保任务具有沿南北或东西方向对齐的长直线段"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:62
#: 440a4fab007c478caa6c184ac5f70446
msgid ""
"Enable real time PID reporting of the position controller's velocity "
"controller"
msgstr "启用位置控制器速度控制器的实时 PID 上报"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:64
#: ac5ae292c06e4cfea4c163e633aa1122
msgid "If the mission runs West-East set GCS_PID_MASK = 64 (Velocity North)"
msgstr "若任务沿东西方向运行，将 GCS_PID_MASK 设为 64（北向速度）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:65
#: ce4621c40d044200b559e84911331cab
msgid "If the mission runs North-South set GCS_PID_MASK = 128 (Velocity East)"
msgstr "若任务沿南北方向运行，将 GCS_PID_MASK 设为 128（东向速度）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:67
#: 648f2a919a0c4cb5bee89e34d23ef7d8
msgid ""
"Display the real-time PID values on the ground station.  If using MP, go to "
"the Data screen, check the \"Tuning\" checkbox.  Double click on the display"
" area and select, \"piddesired\", \"pidachieved\", \"pidP\", \"pidI\" and "
"\"pidD\""
msgstr ""
"在地面站显示实时 PID 值。若使用 Mission "
"Planner，进入数据界面，勾选「Tuning」复选框，双击显示区域并选择「piddesired」、「pidachieved」、「pidP」、「pidI」及「pidD」"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:73
#: f7a8c303fa8a4a71a3c0c4354dfc755a
msgid "Other Parameters"
msgstr "其他参数"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:75
#: 82520bff1b0247d58e831d30d94d0a1d
msgid ""
":ref:`WP_SPEED<WP_SPEED>` defines the target speed (in m/s) that the vehicle"
" will drive at in :ref:`Auto<auto-mode>` and :ref:`Guided<guided-mode>`.  It"
" will also be used in :ref:`RTL<rtl-mode>` and :ref:`SmartRTL<smartrtl-"
"mode>` if :ref:`RTL_SPEED<RTL_SPEED>` is set to zero"
msgstr ""
":ref:`WP_SPEED<WP_SPEED>` 定义车辆在 :ref:`Auto<auto-mode>` 和 "
":ref:`Guided<guided-mode>` 模式下的目标速度（单位：m/s）。若 :ref:`RTL_SPEED<RTL_SPEED>` "
"设为零，该值也将用于 :ref:`RTL<rtl-mode>` 和 :ref:`SmartRTL<smartrtl-mode>` 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:76
#: 7501e212fb3749219778dc10e34e9479
msgid ""
":ref:`WP_RADIUS<WP_RADIUS>` specifies the distance before the waypoint that "
"the vehicle may begin turning towards the next waypoint"
msgstr ":ref:`WP_RADIUS<WP_RADIUS>` 指定车辆在到达航点前可以开始转向下一航点的距离"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:79
#: 5c4a1d1b671941328aaf6715891888d6
msgid "How the Position Controller works"
msgstr "位置控制器工作原理"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:81
#: 7d33cd43e55347a2a22a399887dcfbf9
msgid ""
"Compares the vehicle's current location to the desired location and "
"calculating a desired 2D velocity to close the gap"
msgstr "比较车辆当前位置与目标位置，计算所需的二维速度以消除偏差"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:82
#: 89e8dc0011734ece824527f8ca3611f5
msgid ""
"Compares the vehicle's current velocity to the above velocity (aka position "
"correction velocity) + the S-Curve provided velocity and calculating a "
"desired 2D acceleration to reduce the error"
msgstr "比较车辆当前速度与上述速度（即位置修正速度）加 S 曲线提供速度之和，计算所需的二维加速度以减小误差"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:83
#: efaa211de4a247659af3583269ba0cd6
msgid ""
"The vehicle forward-back portion of position correction velocity + S-Curve "
"velocity is the target forward speed"
msgstr "位置修正速度与 S 曲线速度的车辆前后分量即为目标前进速度"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation.rst:84
#: 7910e5ff4cf3443c98db3fc93220e4e6
msgid ""
"the lateral component of the 2D acceleration becomes the target turn rate"
msgstr "二维加速度的横向分量成为目标转向速率"
